# Dockerfile does `COPY . /src`, and config.yaml holds a live 1Password service
# account token plus AdGuardHome and UniFi passwords. Without this file a local
# `docker build` bakes them into an image layer.
# The build needs only pyproject.toml and network_inventory_manager/.

